WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:04.159
Small icons that react make an interface feel alive.

2
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:10.193
Animated icons carry their trigger in the file: the heart plays on click.

3
00:00:22.233 --> 00:00:27.432
And the bell rings on hover. In code, both are just autoplay.

4
00:00:41.767 --> 00:00:45.267
Change the trigger in the editor, and the code stays the same.
